 "content": "다음 식을 전개하시오.\n⑴ $8m(7m-9)$ ⑵ $(6p+7q)\\times(-9q)$\n⑶ $-7x(8x-6y+9)$ ⑷ $(9a-7b-8)\\times 6b$",
 "choices": [],
 "answer": "⑴ $56m^{2}-72m$ ⑵ $-54pq-63q^{2}$\n⑶ $-56x^{2}+42xy-63x$ ⑷ $54ab-42b^{2}-48b$",
 "solution": "⑴ $8m\\times 7m-8m\\times 9=56m^{2}-72m$이다.\n⑵ $6p\\times(-9q)+7q\\times(-9q)=-54pq-63q^{2}$이다.\n⑶ $(-7x)\\times 8x-(-7x)\\times 6y+(-7x)\\times 9=-56x^{2}+42xy-63x$이다.\n⑷ $9a\\times 6b-7b\\times 6b-8\\times 6b=54ab-42b^{2}-48b$이다.",
 "score": null,
